==================================================================================================================================
run_tax.py: after-tax view of the calm hedge (PLAN.md Addendum 3). Research only. 208 lot simulations in 4s
==================================================================================================================================
Method: after_tax_test.py lot book (FIFO, ST<=365d, wash sales +/-30d same ticker, price-only, tax for year Y paid first session on/after 15 Apr Y+1 by pro-rata sale, 2 bp, BOXX deferred, no $3k offset).
Netting/carry: ST and LT netted separately incl. carryforwards, cross-netted; a net-loss year pays no tax and the loss is carried forward (character kept) to later years' gains. Liquidation basis for after-tax CAGR (unrealized gains treated LT).
Rates: S1 federal ST 38.8% (35+3.8) / LT 18.8% (15+3.8); S2 top+CA ST 50.1% (37+9.3+3.8) / LT 33.1% (20+9.3+3.8). View c: no tax (zero-rate path, realized gains tracked).
After-tax Sharpe / max DD are on the taxed account's daily value changes INCLUDING the April tax-payment sales (as the existing test's MaxDD); 'acc' columns = accrual alternative (tax or credit at the rate on each day's realized ST/LT gain, no cash-flow jumps).
VIXY/VIXM treated as ordinary ETFs (commodity-pool / ETN tax treatment, 60/40 1256 for VIXM-type pools, NOT modelled). Proxy-panel core is its own ticker CORE (adds a 0.6%/yr dividend accrual); QQQ cash legs ticker QQQ; VIXY sleeve and VIXY hedge share ticker VIXY (wash sales across them); VIXM hedge ticker VIXM.
SANITY: zero-rate lot simulation reproduces MC.run_strategy daily returns (max abs diff < 1e-9) for Base / VIXY C1 T18 h5 / its matched cash... and VIXM C5 h10 MC, all 4 windows: PASS
SANITY real Base vs harness.run (VIXY sleeve, cap): max abs diff 4.44e-16

